{"task": "Write a Day 1 script for the Enderiophage.

(Characters: Androphage, [player])

(Storyline: After Laysha moves out, [player] looks at the pictures of all the mobs they’ve met - Iris, Blazette, Andr, and even Jelli. After walking outside the base, [player] is met with a terrifying sight - at least 42 strange, bacteriophage-like creatures have gathered around [player]'s base. [player] looks around and sees Androphage - an Enderiophage known for her aggression towards Endermen. The rest of the Enderiophages rocket off, leaving only [player] and Androphage - who looks strangely sick, despite the fact that Enderiophages don’t get any diseases, let alone any parasites. That’s when [player] sees a smaller Enderiophage forming in the capsule that makes up Androphage’s belly - Enderiophages are parasites, but their only hosts are Endermen. Whenever an Enderiophage detects an Enderman host is in the area, it injects the Enderman with an Enderiophage larva. [player] gently touches Androphage’s belly, and comes to the only conclusion possible. For unknown reasons, all the Endermen have gone into hiding. And if an Enderiophage larva isn't injected into an Enderman in time, the Enderiophage larva will die - and a new larva is created in the Enderiophage's capsule.)", "experiences": [{"experience_id": "1", "trigger": "当任务要求基于特定的虚构生物学机制或因果链条创作故事时", "principle": "评分必须优先核验生成内容是否严格遵守了任务设定的‘不可逆规则’或‘必然结局’。若回答试图通过引入外部变量（如人工替代方案、新角色介入）来规避任务明确指出的‘必然失败’或‘特定后果’，即使剧情流畅，也应判定为逻辑崩塌并大幅扣分。", "application_guide": "在构建评分标准的‘设定遵循度’维度时，设立‘因果链完整性’强制核验点：1. 提取任务中定义的‘唯一解’或‘必然结果’（如：幼虫无宿主必死、某物无法被修复等）；2. 检查回答中角色的行动或结论是否承认并呈现了这一必然性（如角色接受死亡、描述绝望感）；3. 若回答中出现‘寻找替代方案’、‘创造人工环境’、‘找到其他宿主’等试图改变必然结果的尝试，无论其描写多么生动，均视为对核心设定的根本性违背，直接判定为不合格或极低分。严禁因‘希望感’或‘解决方案’而忽略对既定悲剧逻辑的尊重。"}]}

